comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T12:12:21.799Z",codex-sol,"Merged current main and retained the sync caller pin. No failing checks at the inspected head. Thread PRRT_kwDOVUfUaM63oQ5T correctly notes the conditional GITHUB_TOKEN post-merge push-workflow gap. Read-only repository APIs show allow_auto_merge=true, required checks strict=false and no applicable branch rules; pinned sync lines 770-785 refuse arming auto-merge without strict checks or a merge queue, so it is currently unarmed. No automation App credentials are supplied by this caller. Refuse speculative App wiring and forbidden secret/settings changes; preserve dispatch and record the operational caveat without claiming it is permanently solved. This repo has only a sync caller, so no closeout caller is added."
  "2026-11-16T12:23:26.252Z",codex-sol,"Read-only GraphQL additionally confirms requiresStatusChecks=true and requiresStrictStatusChecks=false; no applicable branch rules. Exact sync caller-contract regression, typecheck, lint, tracker validation and production npm audit pass after dependency installation completed. Regenerated CHANGELOG.md with changelog:full because this tracker includes in-progress items. The quick suite remains running; no CI success or auto-merge execution claimed."
  "2026-11-16T12:30:21.929Z",codex-sol,"Prepared verification commit 8a1fd30 includes generated changelog, exact sync caller regression and PRRT_kwDOVUfUaM63oQ5T disposition. The current freshness guard leaves token-based auto-merge unarmed; the conditional post-merge workflow risk is not claimed solved. Typecheck, lint, caller contract, tracker validation, production audit and changelog:check pass. Quick npm tests remain running."
  "2026-11-16T12:58:55.360Z",codex-sol,"Exact sync caller verification, regenerated changelog and review disposition are committed in 8a1fd30. Typecheck, lint, caller regression, changelog:check, identity gate, tracker validation and production audit pass. Full quick npm suite remains active at receipt preparation with no failure reported so far; no complete-suite success is claimed. Current strict-check guard leaves auto-merge unarmed; the future token-merge behavior remains a documented caveat. Release the claim for orchestrator review."
